# Build SIMPLE Spring Boot Backend for "OrderFlow AI"

## IMPORTANT

This is an interview/demo project.

The backend code must be VERY SIMPLE.

I must be able to explain every important line to an interviewer.

Do NOT over-engineer the project.

Use simple:

* Spring Boot
* Java 17
* Spring Web
* Spring Data JPA
* PostgreSQL
* Spring Boot Mail
* Bean Validation
* Maven

Do NOT use:

* Spring Security
* JWT
* OAuth
* Redux
* Complex authentication
* Microservices
* Docker
* Kafka
* Redis
* Lombok unless absolutely necessary
* Complex design patterns
* Interfaces everywhere without a reason
* Complex exception handling
* Custom frameworks

Use normal Java classes, constructors, fields, getters and setters.

