}

==================================================
LOGIN
=====

Endpoint:

POST /api/auth/login

Request:

{
"email": "[rahul@gmail.com](mailto:rahul@gmail.com)"
}

Generate OTP.

Send OTP using SMTP.

Return:

{
"message": "OTP sent successfully"
}

==================================================
VERIFY OTP
==========

Endpoint:

POST /api/auth/verify-otp

Request:

{
"email": "[rahul@gmail.com](mailto:rahul@gmail.com)",
